---
const highlights = [
  { label: 'Quality Tests', value: '1000+' },
  { label: 'Years Lifespan', value: '20+' },
  { label: 'Warranty', value: '12 Yr' },
  { label: 'Protection', value: 'IP66' },
];
---

<section class="py-20 sm:py-28 lg:py-36 bg-white overflow-hidden" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
  <div class="container-main">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center">
      <!-- Left: Content -->
      <div class="order-2 lg:order-1">
        <span class="section-label">
          <span class="w-8 h-px bg-brand-500"></span>
          About Us
        </span>

        <h2 id="about-heading" class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 leading-tight">
          India's Leading <span class="text-gradient">AI-Powered</span> Solar Inverter Brand
        </h2>

        <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-brand-600 font-medium">
          On Grid Inverters, Smart Monitoring Systems and 12 Years Warranty.
        </p>

        <p class="mt-6 text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Qbits is India's next-generation solar inverter brand engineered with the Heaven Group legacy of precision, reliability, and innovation. Designed to deliver stable and intelligent performance for more than 20 years, Qbits inverters combine German-grade electronic components, advanced thermal engineering, and AI-based smart monitoring to ensure unmatched safety and long-term value.
        </p>

        <p class="mt-4 text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Every Qbits inverter undergoes 1000 plus automated quality tests, uses high performance IGBTs and capacitors designed for long lifecycle stability, and is protected by a rugged IP66 enclosure suitable for harsh Indian rooftop conditions.
        </p>

        <p class="mt-4 text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          With AI-powered WhatsApp alerts, 100 percent data security on Indian servers, and a 12-year full replacement warranty, Qbits brings intelligence, durability, and peace of mind to every solar installation.
        </p>

        <!-- Highlight stats -->
        <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-4 gap-4">
          {highlights.map((item) => (
            <div class="text-center p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100">
              <p class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-brand-600">{item.value}</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1 font-medium">{item.label}</p>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Video -->
      <div class="order-1 lg:order-2 relative">
        <div class="rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl bg-slate-100">
          <video
            class="w-full h-auto block"
            src="/about-video.mp4"
            autoplay
            muted
            loop
            playsinline
            preload="metadata"
            poster="/images/features.webp"
            style="aspect-ratio: 4/3; object-fit: cover;"
          ></video>
        </div>
        <div class="absolute -inset-4 bg-brand-500/5 rounded-[2rem] blur-3xl -z-10"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
